==Explanation==
*You have 3 minutes to defeat as many enemies as possible.
*You have unlimited Speed Ups and Cat CPUs but no other power ups.
*The base has unlimited health and can attack Cats that are close to it.
*You gain no money for defeating enemies.
*Defeating enemies will score points and the number varies.
*The total points will decrease overtime.

==Trivia==
*''Paradiso'' means "paradise" in Indonesian, Italian and Swahili.
*Aqua Paradiso's Japanese namesake is "[https://youtu.be/ynCOyUufcEY Osakana Tengoku]" ("Fish Heaven"), a famous song that lists the names of different species of fish.

